/{workflows,actions}/...` (all 8 template workflow/action files copied). `dev/log/issues/812/pulls/813/analysis/` exists but **`template-sweep.md` has not been written yet**.\n\n4. **Errors and fixes:**\n   - The last sweep used `head -5 \"$f\" | grep -c 'set -e...'`, which reported `0` for `check-secrets.sh` and `simulate-fresh-merge.sh` even though both DO set `set -euo pipefail` (at lines 27 and 21 respectively, after long header comments). Fix: re-run the check with a whole-file grep before reporting any \"missing set -euo pipefail\" finding — currently unverified for `sync-seed.sh`, `free-runner-disk.sh`, `desktop-release-resolve.sh`, `install.sh`, `reproduce-issue-538.sh`.\n   - No other tool failures. (The `diff` command exiting 1 on differing files was expected.)\n\n5. **Problem Solving:**\n   - Verified prior iteration's two \"still open\" items are BOTH still open: (i) file-size gate has no `.md`/workflow-YAML coverage while `release.yml` is 1794 lines (js template ceiling 1500); (ii) `desktop-release.yml` never runs `simulate-fresh-merge.sh`.\n   - Accumulated candidate findings not covered by the prior sweep, chiefly: E2E jobs excluded from the release gate (false negative on main); `if: always()` on `finalize` in desktop-release (publishes on cancellation) and on the two `Resolve Pages deploy ref` steps; screenshot artifact upload with `if: always()` and no `if-no-files-found`; missing `include-hidden-files: true` on the Pages artifact; over-scoped `contents: write`/`attestations: write` on PR dry-run desktop builds; missing `cargo-lock` guard job; missing lychee/link + docs validation; single-OS test matrix vs 3-OS; unquoted `origin/$BASE_REF` in simulate-fresh-merge.sh; unpinned `npx --yes secretlint`; `|| true` swallowing in `desktop-release-resolve.sh` (L79, L141, L158, L214), `stamp-pages-artifact.sh` (L63, L72), `free-runner-disk.sh` (L50), `install.sh` (several); template defect candidate (d): python template release.yml missing top-level `permis