[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+/// What a falling trailing share does to the caller.",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+///",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+/// Issue #812: `Auto Release` on `main` died with \"self-hosting ratchet would",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+/// fall from 32.68% to 18.24% for v0.301.0\" (run 29751001867, log line 23918).",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+/// That check runs *after* every contributing commit is already immutable",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+/// history on the default branch, so nothing anybody can do makes it pass, and",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+/// the only way to move the measured range forward — cutting a tag — is exactly",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+/// what it blocks. It is the same shape of permanent outage as issue #810's",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+/// evidence deadlock, and the third release outage in a row (#796, #810, #812)",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+/// caused by enforcing a policy where the policy is not actionable.",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+///",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+/// So enforcement moves to where a contributor can still act on it:",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+///",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+/// - `Enforce` — the pull-request gate (`Self-Hosting Evidence Check` in",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+///   `.github/workflows/release.yml`, via `--check-ratchet`). A fall is a hard",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+///   error while the commits that cause it can still be amended.",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+/// - `Report` — release recording. The row is appended exactly as measured, the",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+///   fall is announced on stderr and as a GitHub `::warning` annotation, and the",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+///   release ships. The ledger records the regression honestly instead of",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+///   hiding it behind a job that never completes.",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+#[derive(Clone, Copy, Debug, Eq, PartialEq)]",
[2026-07-20T17:20:08.308Z] [INFO]           "+pub enum RatchetPolicy {",
