[2026-07-20T17:25:26.652Z] [INFO]           "file_path": "/tmp/gh-issue-solver-1784567326843/dev/log/issues/812/pulls/813/analysis/macos-codesign.md",
[2026-07-20T17:25:26.652Z] [INFO]           "old_string": "Today the desktop packaging dry run only runs on pull requests\n(`desktop-release.yml:173`, `if: github.event_name == 'pull_request'` branch).\nA tag is therefore cut from `main` without any macOS packaging having run on the\nmerge result. Add a `push: branches: [main]` trigger for the macOS build matrix",
[2026-07-20T17:25:26.652Z] [INFO]           "new_string": "The workflow's triggers are `release`, `workflow_dispatch`, `workflow_run` on\n\"CI/CD Pipeline\", and `pull_request` (path-filtered) —\n`desktop-release.yml:36-64`. The PR dry run (added for #808, see the comment at\n`:43-49`) validates the *pull request head*, not the merge result, and there is\nno `push` trigger, so a tag can still be cut from a `main` on which macOS\npackaging never ran. Add a `push: branches: [main]` trigger for the macOS build matrix"
[2026-07-20T17:25:26.652Z] [INFO]         },
[2026-07-20T17:25:26.652Z] [INFO]         "caller": {
[2026-07-20T17:25:26.652Z] [INFO]           "type": "direct"
