[2026-07-20T17:39:33.262Z] [INFO]           "command": "git add -A && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nfix(ci): stop the self-hosting ratchet from deadlocking every release\n\n`Auto Release` on main died with \"self-hosting ratchet would fall from\n32.68% to 18.24% for v0.301.0\" (run 29751001867, log line 23918), so no\ntag could be cut. Two independent root causes, both fixed here.\n\n1. The denominator measured log volume, not work. `changed_lines_for_commit`\n   counted every numstat pair, and in the failing v0.300.0..HEAD range\n   599,340 of 636,240 lines (94.20%) were the captured CI transcripts that\n   `dev/log/issues/<n>/pulls/<n>/` bundles are required to hold. The\n   distortion ran both ways: v0.300.0 was under-reported (69.56% -> 77.41%)\n   and the next window over-reported (18.24% -> 4.36%). `is_non_authored_path`\n   now excludes captured artifacts and lockfiles symmetrically from numerator\n   and denominator, so filing evidence cannot move the share. `METRIC_VERSION`\n   marks the epoch on every row and the ratchet and trailing window only ever\n   compare rows of the same epoch; no history is rewritten.\n\n2. The gate ran where nobody could act on it. Enforcement sat in\n   `record_release`, on main, after every contributing commit was immutable,\n   and the only way to move the range forward -- cutting a tag -- was what it\n   blocked. Third outage of that shape in a row (#796, #810, #812).\n   `RatchetPolicy::Report` records the fall as a `::warning` and ships the\n   release; `RatchetPolicy::Enforce` moves to the pull-request gate via a new\n   `--check-ratchet` mode. That check is differential -- this branch against\n   its base -- so a regression already on main cannot fail unrelated pull\n   requests, and it skips loudly when the ledger's last tag is absent from\n   the checkout rather than turning that into a red check.\n\nVerified: the exact command that failed in CI now exits 0 with\n4.36% (1608/36896 changed lines). Four regression tests added.\n\nFormal-AI-Session: issue-812-claude-20260720\nFormal-AI-Evidence: dev/log/issues/812/pulls/813/analysis.md\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1"
