[2026-07-20T18:50:14.051Z] [INFO]           "+    # same reason: a job that legitimately skipped itself (no relevant changes)",
[2026-07-20T18:50:14.051Z] [INFO]           "+    # must not block the release.",
[2026-07-20T18:50:14.051Z] [INFO]           "+    #",
[2026-07-20T18:50:14.051Z] [INFO]           "+    # They must NOT be written as `!= 'failure'`. A job killed by its own",
[2026-07-20T18:50:14.051Z] [INFO]           "+    # `timeout-minutes` is reported as **cancelled**, not failed -- run",
[2026-07-20T18:50:14.051Z] [INFO]           "+    # 29767811026 is the proof: `Test (ubuntu-latest)` hit the 15-minute cap and",
[2026-07-20T18:50:14.051Z] [INFO]           "+    # `needs.test.result` was 'cancelled'. Under `!= 'failure'` a timed-out",
