[2026-07-20T18:50:14.051Z] [INFO]           "+    # anyway. Enumerating the two acceptable results closes that (issue #812).",
[2026-07-20T18:50:14.051Z] [INFO]           "     if: |",
[2026-07-20T18:50:14.051Z] [INFO]           "       !cancelled() &&",
