[2026-07-20T18:52:25.694Z] [INFO]           "+      # before a test runs, and the suite itself takes ~11m of which eight",
[2026-07-20T18:52:25.694Z] [INFO]           "+      # individual agentic/driver tests exceed 60 s each. 25 minutes reflects the",
[2026-07-20T18:52:25.694Z] [INFO]           "+      # measured cost with headroom; the timer below makes further creep visible",
[2026-07-20T18:52:25.694Z] [INFO]           "+      # in the run summary instead of surfacing as a mystery cancellation two",
[2026-07-20T18:52:25.694Z] [INFO]           "+      # months from now. Reducing those eight tests is real work, tracked",
[2026-07-20T18:52:25.694Z] [INFO]           "+      # separately -- inflating the cap silently is what this avoids.",
