ed. Measured run 29767811026 against each\ndeclared cap, then checked the trend on the last eight main runs:\n\n  coverage  14.1 min worst of 15  (94%) -- 11.2 11.4 11.5 11.9 12.6 12.7 13.5 14.1\n  lint       7.8 min worst of 10  (78%) -- was ~3.3 before checks accumulated\n  e2e-local  9.4 min worst of 15  (63%) -- real headroom, left alone\n  docker    14.0 min worst of 60  (23%) -- real headroom, left alone\n\ncoverage was one run away from the identical false failure. Each new\nnumber carries its measurements inline so it is auditable rather than\narbitrary.\n\nAlso swept: no `needs.<job>.result != 'failure'` comparison remains in\neither workflow.\n\nVerified: actionlint exits 0; ci_cd:: 136 passed, 0 failed.\n\nFormal-AI-Session: issue-812-claude-20260720\nFormal-AI-Evidence: dev/log/issues/812/pulls/813/analysis.md\" && git push -q origin issue-812-7f9674a82402 && echo PUSHED",
